sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Renderer
    participant Main as Main process
    participant Core as packages/core
    participant Disk as Local registry
    participant GH as GitHub API
    participant Origin as Origin repo trees

    Note over UI,Disk: Boot
    UI->>Main: app ready
    Main->>Core: reconcileFoldersToManifest
    Core->>Disk: stamp url-null rows for orphan folders
    Main->>Core: buildRegistryIndex folders x manifest x runtime
    Main->>Core: initProbeRunner

    Note over UI,Origin: Pull from linked repo
    UI->>Main: Import / Pull
    Main->>Core: fetchRemoteManifest
    Core->>GH: GET registry-manifest.json
    Core->>GH: GET .claude-plugin/plugin.json optional
    Core->>Core: mergePluginDeclaredSkills
    Core->>Core: toPushedProjection then mergeManifests base ours theirs
    alt conflicts
        Core-->>UI: ManifestConflictModal
        UI->>Main: keep-mine / use-theirs / keep-both
    end
    loop each restorable skill
        Core->>Origin: mirror skill folder from origin.url
        Core->>Disk: write skills/bucket/name
        Core->>Disk: write live manifest row + runtime hash
    end

    Note over UI,GH: Push to linked repo
    UI->>Main: Export / Push
    Main->>Core: exportRegistryManifest fold labels
    Core->>Core: serializeManifest drops url-null rows
    Core->>GH: GET current file SHA
    alt fast-forward safe
        Core->>GH: PUT registry-manifest.json commit or PR branch
    else diverged remote
        Core-->>UI: refuse to clobber
    end

    Note over UI,Origin: Origin probe and Update
    Main->>Core: probe scheduled
    Core->>Origin: recursive tree SHA
    Core->>Disk: runtime.json probeFailureCount or skillUpdateAvailable
    UI->>Main: Update
    Main->>Core: applySkillUpdate tarball swap
    Note right of Core: Does not shell npx skills update
